"Enable testing mode (t=y). DKIM signatures will be present but not enforced. "
"Use during initial deployment."
msgstr "Dayakan mod ujian (t=y). Tandatangan DKIM akan hadir tetapi tidak dikuatkuasakan. Gunakan semasa pelaksanaan awal."

